%% Retrieve-Credential (CAAPI)
%% Fetch a pre-existing proof-of-possession or bearer-token credential.
%% The Secret Vault is the RATS Relying Party; it wraps the credential to CEKpub.
sequenceDiagram
    participant CAI as CAI
    participant CAS_C as CAS<br/>Client
    participant CAS_S as CAS<br/>Server
    participant V as Verifier
    participant SV as Secret<br/>Vault

    autonumber

    note over CAI, CAS_C: CAAPI
    CAI->>CAS_C: Retrieve-Credential<br/>(Target, Credential Type, Credential Hint,<br/>Evidence, Encryption Algorithm)
    note over CAS_C, CAS_S: CAS Protocol
    CAS_C->>CAS_S: Retrieve-Credential<br/>(Target, Credential Type, Credential Hint,<br/>Evidence, Encryption Algorithm)
    note over CAS_S, V: Passport model (Background Check<br/>is equivalent from the Attester's view)
    CAS_S->>V: Appraise Evidence
    V->>V: Check Evidence, report the<br/>TACRA Binding digest (freshness input)<br/>in Attestation Results
    V-->>CAS_S: Attestation Results
    note over CAS_S, SV: Secret Vault is the RATS RP
    CAS_S->>SV: Retrieve<br/>(Attestation Results, Target, CEKpub,<br/>Credential Hint)
    SV->>SV: Validate Attestation Results
    SV->>SV: Recompute TACRA Binding over<br/>freshness, Target, and CEKpub
    SV->>SV: Map Attestation Results to credential
    SV->>SV: Wrap credential to CEKpub
    SV-->>CAS_S: Wrapped credential
    CAS_S-->>CAS_C: Wrapped credential
    CAS_C-->>CAI: Wrapped credential
